@baseUrl = http://localhost:5231

### 1. List Order: Pagination
Get {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 2. Detail Order: Include + ThenInclude
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/66
Accept: application/json

### Buat Order Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderNumber": "ORD-003",
    "items": [
        {"productCode": "P001", "quantity": 5},
        {"productCode": "P002", "quantity": 10}
    ]
}

### Konfirmasi order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/1/confirm
Accept: application/json

### Mengulangi konfirmasi order
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/2/confirm
Accept: application/json
